  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：全球市场日报-AI观点追踪市场变化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">市场对AI公司的定价已包含相当乐观的假设，而这份GS报告提供了一个更精细的观察工具：把AI叙事拆成“总量”和“分配”两个维度，用半导体与超大规模云厂商的报价联动来追踪市场究竟在关注什么。结论是，自<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>初以来，市场对AI总量的关注只出现过三次，但分配层面的波动要频繁和剧烈得多。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX8IdzlcFIDAK5u85jicTGaPwK6GTYBNz7mD1aRqBVF352Vfd7ZevCHB8Q8XTibXaXdJfhNv9epaDJjHh5YzvrtVMEgFia2z0jjqk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWuTic8AJtUibkBUSsYYnbobdow6RfE3HY0OaTFaHVldPvrwTP13NFb5nH5r15znvtyaCnmeYJpbIREdyDFtLW5F7LplYrfsAOok/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUdx3ibAKZEic5zIzDtiamNJxApOspMMCANCbgdr5XOrB3rANSl5ic388SlAhPPM67gBrS1rjMf5nRKIfhS0FBicBgDwy5ibnGOWrACY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or e